WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:17.378
"Oh no!" cried the Ghost Bandit.

2
00:00:17.379 --> 00:00:19.702
He was covered in ink.

3
00:00:19.703 --> 00:00:22.264
Now Roxy could see the villain.

4
00:00:22.265 --> 00:00:24.181
He was tall and thin.

5
00:00:24.182 --> 00:00:26.453
He carried a large bag.

6
00:00:26.454 --> 00:00:29.243
A round object was on his back.

7
00:00:29.244 --> 00:00:33.577
"That's probably a battery for his suit," Roxy thought.

8
00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:36.878
"That's how he stays invisible."

9
00:00:36.879 --> 00:00:41.662
"You still won't catch me!" yelled the Ghost Bandit.

10
00:00:41.663 --> 00:00:44.154
He held up a small device.

11
00:00:44.155 --> 00:00:47.190
Shling! A claw shot out.

12
00:00:47.191 --> 00:00:49.235
It was attached to a cable.

13
00:00:49.236 --> 00:00:52.337
The claw hooked onto a windowsill high up.

14
00:00:52.338 --> 00:00:55.729
The Ghost Bandit pressed a button on the device.

15
00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:59.587
The cable quickly pulled the villain up to the windowsill.

16
00:00:59.588 --> 00:01:04.300
Roxy laughed. "You can't escape," she said.

17
00:01:04.301 --> 00:01:07.867
"Police have the entire building surrounded."

18
00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:11.473
The Ghost Bandit looked down and saw all the police.

19
00:01:11.474 --> 00:01:14.970
Some news reporters had arrived too.

20
00:01:14.971 --> 00:01:21.043
"Ha!" cried the Ghost Bandit. "There's a fountain!"

21
00:01:21.044 --> 00:01:27.349
He fired the device again.

22
00:01:27.350 --> 00:01:29.895
Then he shot out the window.

23
00:01:29.896 --> 00:01:31.965
"Uh-oh!" said Roxy.

24
00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:35.413
She flew as fast as she could.

25
00:01:35.414 --> 00:01:39.611
Outside, she saw the Ghost Bandit zipping above the police.

26
00:01:39.612 --> 00:01:41.632
A police officer looked up.

27
00:01:41.633 --> 00:01:44.953
"There's the Ghost Bandit!" he cried.

28
00:01:44.954 --> 00:01:48.077
The Ghost Bandit was soon above the fountain.

29
00:01:48.078 --> 00:01:50.389
Roxy watched the villain.

30
00:01:50.390 --> 00:01:55.136
"If he lands in that water, he'll be invisible again!" she thought.

31
00:01:55.137 --> 00:01:58.069
The Ghost Bandit dropped down.

32
00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:01.183
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

33
00:02:01.184 --> 00:02:05.722
Whiz-hoo! The battery exploded.

34
00:02:05.723 --> 00:02:12.815
Splash! The Ghost Bandit leaped out of the fountain.

35
00:02:12.816 --> 00:02:15.328
"Ha-ha!" He laughed.

36
00:02:15.329 --> 00:02:18.366
"Now you'll never catch me!

37
00:02:18.367 --> 00:02:21.061
I'll—oh no!"

38
00:02:21.062 --> 00:02:24.887
The Ghost Bandit saw his reflection in a store window.

39
00:02:24.888 --> 00:02:30.920
"My suit—it's ruined!"

40
00:02:30.921 --> 00:02:34.529
Roxy's friends were still watching TV in Jack's house.

41
00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:37.487
The news reporter was talking to Roxy.

42
00:02:37.488 --> 00:02:40.220
The Ghost Bandit was in handcuffs.

43
00:02:40.221 --> 00:02:43.522
Police officers were taking money out of the bag.

44
00:02:43.523 --> 00:02:46.398
"Rocket Girl," said the reporter.

45
00:02:46.399 --> 00:02:52.542
"Is that the villain you were chasing earlier today?"

46
00:02:52.543 --> 00:02:56.389
Roxy smiled. "That's the Ghost Bandit.

47
00:02:56.390 --> 00:02:57.983
He was invisible.

48
00:02:57.984 --> 00:03:00.729
But I finally caught him!"

49
00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:04.838
"So Rocket Girl is a good guy, folks," said the reporter.

50
00:03:04.839 --> 00:03:08.779
"And thanks to her, Metro City is safe once again!

51
00:03:08.780 --> 00:03:13.251
Now back to Mighty Man."

52
00:03:13.252 --> 00:03:17.067
"I knew Rocket Girl was innocent," said Terrell.

53
00:03:17.068 --> 00:03:19.147
Jack and Mara smiled.

54
00:03:19.148 --> 00:03:23.457
"I'm glad Rocket Girl isn't a bad guy," said Jack.

55
00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:25.385
Roxy walked into the room.

56
00:03:25.386 --> 00:03:27.883
She had a big smile.

57
00:03:27.884 --> 00:03:30.631
"Hey, everybody! I'm back."

58
00:03:30.632 --> 00:03:33.939
Terrell looked at the TV and then at Roxy.

59
00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.437
"Are you feeling better?"

60
00:03:36.438 --> 00:03:39.080
Roxy flopped onto the sofa.

61
00:03:39.081 --> 00:03:45.095
"I feel great!"
